1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,800
[a car approaches, a radio is tuned]

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
[road rock plays on the car radio]

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:18,400
RADIO: KUDAKHSTAN! The place where all chickens
go to co-co-cosmos! Thousands have already gone!

4
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,000
Ambitious chickens fly higher than mountains.

5
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:31,800
Unambitious chickens also fly. Once.
Between two slices of bread.

6
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,000
[a stamp comes down]

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,600
RADIO: And not one chicken came back!

8
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:39,000
(singing) Every sign says eat in, take away,

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
(singing) not this chick, not today.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,200
[shotgun blast]

11
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,000
(singing) Kudakh, kudakh, the road is long...

12
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,400
UNCLE KOLYA: Tell me, little one. Why cosmos?

13
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:03,000
[fire crackles, the song plays on quietly]

14
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:07,800
Because up there, nobody is hungry.

15
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,100
[a fridge hums]

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,500
(singing) To co-co-cosmos, I'll be kudakh!
